Do not upload this directory directly.

Generate the ready-to-upload package from the repository root with:

  bash scripts/package-arxiv-source.sh

The generated output/arxiv/policywatcher-arxiv-beta21-source.zip contains the
top-level file policywatcher-arxiv.tex and the dated public operational snapshot
under data/. The TeX source is self-contained, embeds its bibliography, and
requires no figures, style files, scripts, PDFs, Word documents, or TeX build
output. The JSON and README are ancillary evidence artifacts and are not needed
for compilation.

Processor: LaTeX in PDF mode (PDFLaTeX) or an equivalent current LaTeX
processor offered by arXiv.
